{
  "_doc": "v1 SAS golden master (S-9). `v1_facts` are exactly what v1's heuristic_scan_tables / SAS_*_REGEX would extract — the parity floor. `v2_improvements` are facts v2's richer adapter is expected to add. The Phase-1 SAS parity test (P1-T1) asserts v2 reproduces v1_facts AND adds v2_improvements.",
  "language": "SAS",
  "v1_facts": {
    "inputs": ["lib.transactions", "work.base", "work.summary"],
